    {
      "id": 17,
      "type": "Note",
      "title": "H3 requirements and limits",
      "pos": [
        20,
        1160
      ],
      "size": [
        2400,
        350
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 7,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "STANDARD NATIVE H3 REF2VA: no Ollama and no automatic reference-role routing.\nUpload your subject in LoadImage. Add more LoadImage nodes to the native Ref2VA image inputs as needed, up to 9. Picture numbers follow connection order.\nWrite the H3 prompt directly in the native Ref2VA node. For an identity baseline, use only subject photos; a raw pose image can compete with identity.\nOptional LoRA stays disabled until you select a compatible file. Include its trigger words in your prompt manually.\nThe profile installer chooses full BF16 or lite full INT8 model names. No pruned models and no turbo adapter.\nFull: 768x1344 -> exact 756x1344 (9:16); Lite: 576x1024. For 2:3 use 768x1152 full or 576x864 lite and set the crop node to 2:3.\nThe final-frame node decodes the completed MP4 and saves its matching _last.png. A reference is not a guaranteed hard first-frame constraint."
      ]
    },
